{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1759575,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"amber-dark_un","paid":0,"title":"Aarohan TechMela 2026","festival_id":null,"organization_id":946,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-09-21T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-10T20:01:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/aarohan-techmela-2026-nit-durgapur-1759575","region":"hybrid","details":"<ul>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligibility:<\/strong> Open to all undergraduate (B.Tech \/ B.E. \/ B.Sc \/ BBA \/ BCA), postgraduate (M.Tech \/ MBA \/ MCA \/ M.Sc), and diploma students across recognized institutions.<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Team Composition:<\/strong> Participants can compete individually or in teams of <strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">1 to 3 members<\/strong> .<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inter-College Teams:<\/strong> Allowed. Team members do not need to be from the same college or university.<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inter-Specialization Teams:<\/strong> Allowed. Cross-departmental collaborations (e.g., engineering students teaming with management students) are highly encouraged.<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Number of Problem Statements \/ Tracks:<\/strong> Competitors can choose from multiple problem tracks spanning Software Engineering, Core Robotics, Data &amp; AI, Product &amp; Business Strategy, and Case Consulting.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Documents required:&nbsp;<\/strong>College ID Card, Aadhar Card of Team members, NOC from college in case of accomodation.<\/li>\n<li>Note: All shortlisted teams have to make arrangements for their travel by their own.<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rounds &amp; Duration:<\/strong>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4,5,1